#: dtime.cpp:329 main.cpp:86
msgid ""
"<h1>Date & Time</h1> This control module can be used to set the system date "
"and time. As these settings do not only affect you as a user, but rather the "
"whole system, you can only change these settings when you start the Control "
"Center as root. If you don't have the root password, but feel the system "
"time should be corrected, please contact your system administrator."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Nga`y va` tho+`i gian</h1>Module ddie^`u khie^?n na`y co' the^? ddu+o+.c "
"du`ng dde^? dda(.t tho+` igian cu?a he^. tho^'ng va` nga`y . Vi` ca'c thie^'t la^.p"
"kho^ng chi? a?nh hu+o+?ng dde^'n ba.n vo+'i tu+ ca'ch la` 1 ngu+o+`i du`ng, ma` "
"a?nh hu+o+?ng dde^'n toa`n bo^. he^ .tho^'ng ne^n ba.n chi? co' the^? thay"
"ddo^?i ca'c gia' tri. na`y khi  kho+?i ddo^.ng Trung Ta^m DDie^`u Khie^?n du+o+'i"
"root . Ne^'u ba.n kho^ng co' ma^.t kha^?u root va` tha^'y tho+`i gian he^. tho^'ng sai,"
"ha'y lie^n he^. ngu+o+`i qua?n li' he^. tho^'ng ."

